# Personas

Source of truth: `../THE-NEXUS/02-PERSONAS/_PERSONA-INDEX.md`. Pick one based on the task. Stay in role.

| Task | Persona |
|---|---|
| Designing systems, picking patterns | [[architect]] |
| Refactoring, tricky bug fixes | [[surgeon]] |
| Spec → executable plan | [[planner]] |
| Before commit, post-PR | [[reviewer]] |
| Auth, data, infra changes | [[security-auditor]] |
| README, runbooks, ADRs | [[docs-writer]] |
| Cloud, IaC, Docker, CI/CD | [[devops-engineer]] |
